      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US SEC EDGAR Filings & Insider Trading Radar (10-K/8-K/Form 4) Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nExtracts and audits official U.S. SEC EDGAR corporate filings (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, Form 4 Insider Trading) via data.sec.gov. Calculates governance risk scores (0-100) and generates Markdown legal/financial briefs for M&A, hedge funds, and AI RAG agents.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
